      "name": "replicationstreams",
      "description": {
        "content": "This path enables you to manage replication streams. Note that for the general case, replication streams belong to protected paths and are managed as part of protected path management. However, for the use case where you configure replication to an S3 replication peer and to an aync replication peer on the same path, use this path instead.",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
